From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] phy: qcom: qmp-combo: add SM4450 USB3/DP configuration

Nearly identical to sm8350, but some diverging tunigns.
Ported frmo downstream.

batocera: linux 7.2 dropped qmp_v4_calibrate_dp_phy() and moved every
SoC that used it, sm8450 included, onto qmp_v3_calibrate_dp_phy(), so
use that here too. The only difference was an extra 0x20 entry at the
head of the DP AUX cfg1 retraining table.

---
--- a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
@@ -1063,6 +1063,65 @@
 	QMP_PHY_INIT_CFG(QPHY_V5_PCS_USB3_RXEQTRAINING_DFE_TIME_S2, 0x07),
 };
 
+/* SM4450: sm8350 tables with stock-firmware tuning deltas */
